Note on what this software produces
-----------------------------------

Lutron Builder generates project files that are used to programme real lighting
control systems in real buildings. The schedules it produces are read from
drawings by an AI and are, in part, PROPOSED rather than read -- circuit
groupings, scene levels and keypad engraving text in particular.

Nothing it produces should be transferred to a processor, ordered from a
manufacturer, or issued for construction without being checked by a competent
person against the drawings. The disclaimer above applies in full.

Lutron, HomeWorks, Palladiom, Alisse, Aviena and seeTouch are trademarks of
Lutron Electronics Co., Inc. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or supported by Lutron Electronics.
